  m_text: "Thank you for playing Cardificer! This was a project the team made for
    fun after meeting at Game Developers' Conference in 2023. \n\nIf you enjoyed,
    feel free to give it a few more runs. The floor is randomly generated, so you
    might find some new secrets ;)\n\nPlease check out our amazing team in the Credits
    page on the Main Menu. We hope you enjoyed this little demo!\n\n- Cardboard Games"
